sequenceDiagram
 autonumber
 participant Parent as Parent model
 participant Task as TaskToolInvocation
 participant Orchestrator as SubagentOrchestrator
 participant Assembly as ChildAgentAssembly
 participant Scope as SubAgentScope
 participant Child as Cheap child model
 participant Scheduler as Child scheduler lease
 participant Tools as Host tools
 participant Outputs as self_emitvalue
 Parent->>Task: task(subagent_name, goal_prompt, whitelist, expected_outputs)
 Task->>Orchestrator: launchChild(request)
 Orchestrator->>Orchestrator: load subagent and explicitly cheaper profile
 Orchestrator->>Assembly: assembleChild(config, runtime identity)
 Assembly->>Scope: fresh chat, admitted tools, cancellation and budgets
 Scope->>Child: goal and child tool declarations
 Child->>Scheduler: run_shell_command resolve HEAD and ten commits
 Scheduler->>Tools: normal policy, approval and execution
 Tools-->>Child: commit IDs in child context
 Child->>Scheduler: batched diff-tree calls for commit paths
 Tools-->>Child: changed paths in child context
 Child->>Scheduler: read_file on deduplicated paths
 Tools-->>Child: file contents in child context
 Child->>Scheduler: run_shell_command blame for TODO lines
 Tools-->>Child: authors and line evidence in child context
 Child->>Child: group, inspect omissions and coverage
 Child->>Outputs: summary and evidence outputs
 Outputs-->>Scope: collected output variables
 Scope-->>Task: emitted outputs, final text, termination metadata
 Task-->>Parent: one task result
 Note over Scope,Parent: Child transcript stays separate, child inference still contributes to total usage
 opt composition
 Child->>Scheduler: execute_tool_script for mechanical gathering
 Scheduler-->>Child: selected JSON before child interpretation
